<hr data-start=3D"1616" data-end=3D"1619">
<h2 data-start=3D"1621" data-end=3D"1651">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong data-start=
=3D"1627" data-end=3D"1651">Important Properties</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1652" data-end=3D"1884">=E2=9C=85 Always <strong data-star=
t=3D"1661" data-end=3D"1674">converges</strong> (SSE never increases)<br da=
